# Everything else this fork generates is covered by the repo-root
# .gitignore. Only what is genuinely local to this port is left here.

# claude: kept local - "initcode" is a GENERATED blob here, but a
# checked-in one in arm-pi1/arm-pi2/arm-pi3, so it must never be hoisted.
initcode
# claude: kept local - usys.S is GENERATED from usys.pl in this fork, but
# is a hand-written tracked SOURCE file in the nine forks without usys.pl.
# Hoisting it would mark those nine as ignored.
ulib/usys.S
kernel/ramdisk.h
